# Production server (ESS Tracker / timetrack)

When the user asks to deploy, refresh the server, or restart the web app after code changes, **use this host** — do not assume `/opt/esstracker` on the dev machine is production.

## Public URL

- **App:** https://tracker.euclideesolutions.com
- **Hostname:** `server.euclideesolutions.com`

